# GetFit environment variables.
# Copy to .env.local for local development. Never commit real values (AGENTS §12).
# Every variable the app reads must be documented here, with where it is used.
#
# No variables are required yet. Supabase (P1-02/P1-04), Sentry and PostHog (P1-15)
# and the test clock GETFIT_TEST_NOW (P1-16, D20) are added by the tasks that use them.
